ple in Bulgaria\". President Iotova has [the highest approval rating](https://www.ibnaeu.com/en/2026/08/07/rumen-radev-first-100-days-government-bulgaria-poll/) among Bulgaria's senior state officials.&#x20;\n\nIotova served as the country's Vice President from January 2017 until her ascent to presidency.","resolution_criteria":"This question will resolve as the percentage vote share received by Iliana Iotova in the first round of the Bulgarian presidential election scheduled to be held on October 25, 2026, as declared by the [Bulgarian Central Election Commission](https://results.cik.bg/).","fine_print":"If the election is postponed or cancelled such that no result is declared on or before December 31, 2026, this question will be **annulled**.","short_title":"What vote share will Iotova win in 2026 Bulgarian Presidential election?","post_id":45262,"aggregations":{"recency_weighted":{"history":null,"latest":null,"score_data":null,"movement":null}},"average_coverage":null,"my_forecasts":{"history":[{"question_id":45452,"author_id":309213,"start_time":1790450108.623115,"end_time":1791497583.625127,"forecast_values":[0.005637902,0.0064608374,0.0073795995,0.0084068083,0.0095567458,0.0108352692,0.0121429947,0.0134507202,0.0147584456,0.0160661711,0.0173738966,0.018681622,0.0199893475,0.021297073,0.0226047984,0.0239125239,0.0252202494,0.0265279748,0.0278357003,0.0291434258,0.0304511512,0.0317588767,0.0330666022,0.0343743276,0.0356820531,0.0369897785,0.038297504,0.0396052295,0.0409129549,0.0422206804,0.0435284059,0.0448361313,0.0461438568,0.0474515823,0.0487593077,0.0500670332,0.0513747587,0.0527412632,0.0556794518,0.0586176405,0.0615558292,0.0644940178,0.0674322065,0.0703703952,0.0733085839,0.0762467725,0.0791849612,0.0821231499,0.0850613385,0.0879995272,0.0909377159,0.0938759046,0.0968140932,0.0997522819,0.1026904706,0.1074377683,0.1126371334,0.1178364985,0.1230358636,0.1282352287,0.1334345938,0.1386339589,0.143833324,0.1490326891,0.1542320542,0.1594314192,0.1646307843,0.